            {
              "content": "You are a recruitment expert. Score how well a candidate matches a job description. Return only valid JSON — no markdown, no explanation.",
              "role": "model"
            },
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert HR recruiter scoring a candidate for a job. Do not use strict keyword matching. Evaluate candidates based on semantic meaning, transferable skills, and overall core competency.\n\nJOB:\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nRequired Skills: {{ $json.requiredSkills }}\nDescription: {{ $json.description }}\n\nCANDIDATE PROFILE:\nName: {{ $json.name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.email }}\nPhone: {{ $json.phone }}\nLocation: {{ $json.location }}\nSummary: {{ $json.rawText }}\nSkills: {{ $json.skills }}\nExperience: {{ $json.experience }}\nEducation: {{ $json.education }}\nCandidate_id: {{ $json._id }}\nStatus: {{ $json.status }}\n\nEvaluation Rules:\n1. Transferable Skills: If a candidate lacks an exact required skill but has strong experience in an equivalent technology (e.g., has Vue.js instead of React, or GCP instead of AWS), consider it a valid match.\n2. Core vs. Bonus: Focus on the fundamental ability to do the job. Do not reject a candidate for missing minor or \"nice-to-have\" skills.\n3. Recommendation Thresholds:\n   - \"shortlist\": match_score 90-100. Meets core requirements or shows strong equivalent experience.\n   - \"review\": match_score 70-89. Missing some specific skills but demonstrates strong foundational potential. Use this instead of rejecting when in doubt.\n   - \"reject\": match_score 0-69. Completely lacks the fundamental skills required for the role.\n\nExtraction Rules:\n- Carefully read the \"Summary\" (rawText) provided above.\n- Extract the candidate's true Full Name, Email, and Phone Number directly from this text to correct any parsing errors. If a value is missing, return null.\n\nScore this candidate against this job and extract their contact details.\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. Do NOT wrap the JSON in ```json markdown blocks. Return only the raw JSON object:\n\n{\n  \"extracted_name\": \"Full Name from rawText\",\n  \"extracted_email\": \"Email from rawText\",\n  \"extracted_phone\": \"Phone from rawText\",\n  \"experience\": \"Real experience outside educational experience like matriculation or BTech etc. \",\n  \"match_score\": 0,\n  \"matchedSkills\": [],\n  \"missingSkills\": [],\n  \"recommendation\": \"shortlist\",\n  \"reason\": \"2 sentence explanation of the score, noting any transferable skills considered.\",\n  \"improve\": \"2 sentence explanation on how candidate can improve his current resume for this job if rejected or reviewed (e.g. - You can improve your resume by...)\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- match_score must be integer 0-100\n- recommendation must be exactly: shortlisted, reviewed, or rejected\n- Output ONLY the raw JSON object without markdown"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simplify": false,
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
